# Reference: Agrippina Vaganova, "Basic Principles of Classical Ballet" (Chassé à la seconde)
# Reference: Royal Academy of Dance (RAD) Classical Ballet Syllabus
# Review status: Experimental (ballet UAT; pending peer review with dance-domain educator)
# Biomechanical note: Chassé (from French chasser, "to chase") is a traveling step-together-step
# movement where one foot glides along the floor into demi-plié and the other foot chases and closes
# into first position. First-position turnout is sustained throughout. Floor foot-pins act as stance-foot
# anchors during gait travel while the opposite leg reaches into the step.

posecode exercise "Chassé"
  rig humanoid
  pose start = first-position

  step "Right foot reaches" 0.65s flow:
    hip_right: abduct 20
    knee_right: flex 20
    ankle_right: plantarflex 25
    ankle_left: plantarflex 15
    shoulders: abduct 60
    elbows: flex 18
    travel: 0.25 0
    pin: foot_left floor
    reach: foot_right floor
    cue "Demi-plié and glide right foot sideways along the floor, leading with the toes"

  step "Left foot chases" 0.5s flow:
    hip_right: abduct 0
    knee_right: flex 15
    ankle_right: plantarflex 0
    hip_left: abduct 16
    knee_left: flex 20
    ankle_left: plantarflex 25
    travel: 0.25 0
    pin: foot_right floor
    cue "Left foot chases under the body to meet in first position demi-plié"

  step "Right foot reaches again" 0.65s flow:
    hip_left: abduct 0
    knee_left: flex 15
    ankle_left: plantarflex 15
    hip_right: abduct 20
    knee_right: flex 20
    ankle_right: plantarflex 25
    travel: 0.5 0
    pin: foot_left floor
    reach: foot_right floor
    cue "Glide right foot out once more to complete the outward chassé travel"

  step "Left foot reaches back" 0.65s flow:
    hip_right: abduct 0
    knee_right: flex 15
    ankle_right: plantarflex 15
    hip_left: abduct 20
    knee_left: flex 20
    ankle_left: plantarflex 25
    travel: 0.25 0
    pin: foot_right floor
    reach: foot_left floor
    cue "Reverse smoothly and slide the left foot back toward the center"

  step "Right foot chases" 0.5s flow:
    hip_left: abduct 0
    knee_left: flex 15
    ankle_left: plantarflex 0
    hip_right: abduct 16
    knee_right: flex 20
    ankle_right: plantarflex 25
    travel: 0.25 0
    pin: foot_left floor
    cue "Right foot chases under the body to close in first position demi-plié"

  step "Left foot closes home" 0.7s settle:
    hip_right: abduct 0
    knee_right: flex 0
    knee_left: flex 0
    ankles: plantarflex 0
    shoulders: abduct 60
    elbows: flex 18
    travel: 0 0
    reach: foot_left floor
    reach: foot_right floor
    cue "Close home in first position with tall posture and arms maintained in second"

  repeat 4
